Docs disagree on hosted-agent traffic splitting (as of 2026-11-03)","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"gmyZXF5Q8FWjjj4PzX1P5","type":"text","x":398.0,"y":4515.48,"width":2452.85,"height":37.5,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["dWpZwHK-Ud6VzSh68q1Cf"],"frameId":null,"index":"b7w","roundness":null,"seed":1481037448,"version":2,"versionNonce":1576517432,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1793750400000,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":15,"fontFamily":5,"text":"The 'Promote hosted agents to production' page (preview) documents FixedRatio traffic splits (for example 90/10, 50/50). The 'Hosted agents' concept page and the 'Manage hosted agents' page say an endpoint serves one version at 100% and traffic splitting isn't supported, and the Architecture Center baseline says there is no\nbuilt-in canary for agents. Treat percentage canaries as preview and in flux. The sequence common to the pages: pin production, test a version-pinned candidate session, promote by re-pointing the selector at 100%, roll back by re-pointing it.","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"The 'Promote hosted agents to production' page (preview) documents FixedRatio traffic splits (for example 90/10, 50/50). The 'Hosted agents' concept page and the 'Manage hosted agents' page say an endpoint serves one version at 100% and traffic splitting isn't supported, and the Architecture Center baseline says there is no\nbuilt-in canary for agents. Treat percentage canaries as preview and in flux. The sequence common to the pages: pin production, test a version-pinned candidate session, promote by re-pointing the selector at 100%, roll back by re-pointing it.","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"TY80Pbv5rCoxCdmN4f3eF","type":"text","x":398.0,"y":4570.98,"width":262.78,"height":15.0,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1971c